<title>UK: Blacks Leisure like-for-like sales up 22%.</title>
<headline>Blacks Leisure like-for-like sales up 22%.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Blacks Leisure Group Plc said on Friday that its like-for like sales for the 44 weeks to January 4, 1997 rose 22 percent, while total sales was up 45 percent.</p>
<p>Like-for-like sales at First Sport, the group's sports retail chain, increased by 22 percent over the previous year, the company said in a statement.</p>
</text>
